@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2D3748
    ActorBorderColor #2D3748
    LifeLineBorderColor #2D3748
    ParticipantBorderColor #2D3748
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BoxBorderColor #A0AEC0
}

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "System / Recruiter" as Caller
control "Spring Security" as Security
control "TenantWebInterceptor" as Interceptor
boundary "EmailNotificationController" as Controller
control "EmailNotificationService" as Service
queue "RabbitMQ notify.email.q" as RabbitMQ
control "EmailConsumerWorker" as Consumer
entity "SMTP Provider" as SMTP
database "Tenant DB (MySQL)" as TenantDB

note over Caller, Security
  Preconditions: tenant ACTIVE; payload valid; SMTP credentials configured.
end note

== Enqueue Email Notification ==

Caller -> Controller: Trigger email request (e.g. Invite, Offer, Interview)
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: sendEmailAsync(request)
activate Service
Service -> Service: Render HTML body via Thymeleaf template

Service -> RabbitMQ: publishEmail(EmailMessageDTO with X-Tenant-ID header)
activate RabbitMQ
RabbitMQ --> Service: Message accepted
deactivate RabbitMQ

Service --> Controller: Void / Async Accepted
deactivate Service
Controller --> Caller: 202 Accepted (Fast HTTP response)
deactivate Controller

== Asynchronous Processing by Worker ==

RabbitMQ -> Consumer: Deliver message (X-Tenant-ID header)
activate Consumer
Consumer -> Consumer: TenantContext.setCurrentTenant(tenantId)

Consumer -> SMTP: Send MimeMessage (SSL/TLS)
activate SMTP

alt SMTP Delivery Success
  SMTP --> Consumer: 250 OK Message accepted
  deactivate SMTP
  Consumer -> TenantDB: INSERT email_logs status = SENT
  activate TenantDB
  TenantDB --> Consumer: Log saved
  deactivate TenantDB
else SMTP Network / Credential Error
  SMTP --> Consumer: Connection failure / Rejected
  Consumer -> TenantDB: INSERT email_logs status = FAILED + errorMessage
  activate TenantDB
  TenantDB --> Consumer: Log saved
  deactivate TenantDB
end

Consumer -> Consumer: TenantContext.clear()
deactivate Consumer

@enduml
